# package-lock.json is the only lockfile: CI installs it with npm ci and
# publishing with npm install. Make dependency changes with npm, so that
# package-lock.json changes with package.json. Where there's no bun.lock,
# bun seeds one from package-lock.json, then keeps using its own, so after
# package-lock.json changes, delete bun.lock before installing with bun.
bun.lock
bun.lockb
